<view class="page"><nav-bar title="给我起名字"></nav-bar><view class="content"><view class="mini-egg"></view><text class="title">你想叫我什么？</text><text class="desc">这个名字会陪我很久。每天最多可以改一次。</text><view class="input-wrap"><input class="name-input" value="{{name}}" maxlength="10" placeholder="最多 10 个字符" bindinput="onInput" focus/><text class="counter">{{count}} / 10</text></view><text wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</text><view class="spacer"></view><button class="primary" bindtap="onSave" disabled="{{saving}}"><text class="button-label">{{saving ? '正在同步名字…' : '确认这个名字'}}</text></button></view></view>
